{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劉兆銘離世｜劉兆銘（Ming Sir）離世，享年94歲。回顧其精彩的演藝生涯，他在1991年無綫劇集《今生無悔》中的精湛演出絕對令人印象深刻，當年他與天王黎明在劇中合作，擦出不少火花。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"42817655-50f7-43a4-991c-406a2049db76.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026GpCoJh8tUh1788407841.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"42817655-50f7-43a4-991c-406a2049db76.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"05ce64fb-20db-4c51-b78d-fd9e9baffbf6.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ue58N2Zegl1788407842.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"05ce64fb-20db-4c51-b78d-fd9e9baffbf6.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《今生無悔》當年播出後大受歡迎，成功榮登年度收視冠軍。劇中劉兆銘與黎明多次上演激烈的衝突戲碼，作為好戲之人的劉兆銘，將身為父親的內疚以及埋藏在心底裡的愛完美演繹，扣人心弦的父子情成為劇集一大亮點，該劇同時亦奠定了黎明的天王地位。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4bbebdd5-df21-4461-8b1d-362ed78516f2.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026AKgzxiFAFM1788407842.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4bbebdd5-df21-4461-8b1d-362ed78516f2.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了在螢幕上合作無間，劉兆銘與黎明在戲外同樣情同父子。2016年，黎明於中環海濱舉辦4D演唱會時，當時年事已高的劉兆銘亦專程親臨現場力撐對方，足證兩人之間的感情極為深厚。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T04:24:02.168673+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":293,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}